### 12. Specify Databricks Runtime & Cluster Policy (Section 4)

```markdown
> **Databricks configuration:**
> - Use **Databricks Runtime 14.x LTS or later** (LTS for stability in a 
>   24/7 streaming job).
> - Streaming jobs should run on a **dedicated job cluster** (not a shared 
>   interactive cluster) with autoscaling between a min/max node range sized 
>   to handle the burst throughput target (50k events/sec).
> - Enable **Photon** for the Silver/Gold batch transformation jobs 
>   (significant speedup on Delta MERGE operations).
> - Use **Unity Catalog** as the metastore (not the legacy Hive metastore) 
>   for consistent governance across Bronze/Silver/Gold.
```

